@startuml sendMessage
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

title
sendMessage – Publish Message to Kafka Topic
end title

participant "Requestor" as requestor
participant "p1KafkaProducer" as send #LightCyan
participant "Kafka" as kafka #LightYellow

requestor -> send: sendMessage(topic, message)
activate send

send -> kafka: {send message to topic}
activate kafka

kafka --> send: send response
deactivate kafka

note over send
  <u>Processing</u>
  - Verify producer availability  
  - Serialize message  
  - Send message to topic  
  - Handle send success or failure  
end note

send --> requestor: Response object ({ status: "SUCCESS" }/{ status: "FAILED", reason })
deactivate send

@enduml